<title>USA: Iwerks Entertainment names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Iwerks Entertainment names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BURBANK, Calif. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iwerks Entertainment Inc said Monday it has appointed Bruce Hinckley chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>Hinckley replaces Francis Phalen, who resigned as the company's chief financial officer in June to pursue personal business interests.</p>
<p>Hinckley was the chief accounting officer for more than 10 years of Caesars World Inc, a gaming and hospitality company that was acquired last year by ITT Corp.</p>
